### Aprovações de timesheet
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-token: {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 14,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_timesheet_approvals",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}

### Criar apontamento (escreve na conta)
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-token: {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 15,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_time_entry",
    "arguments": {
      "project_id": {{projectId}},
      "date_execution": "2026-10-14",
      "time_total": "01:00:00",
      "description": "Exemplo via HTTP Client"
    }
  }
}

### Editar apontamento (só os campos enviados)
@EditTimeEntryId = 856
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-token: {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 16,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "update_time_entry",
    "arguments": {
      "timeEntryId": {{EditTimeEntryId}},
      "description": "Descrição alterada pelo exemplo..."
    }
  }
}

### Apagar apontamento (destrutivo; confirm é obrigatório neste HTTP)
@DeleteTimeEntryId = 856
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-token: {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 19,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "delete_time_entry",
    "arguments": {
      "timeEntryId": {{DeleteTimeEntryId}},
      "confirm": true,
      "reason": "Exemplo do HTTP Client"
    }
  }
}

### Iniciar cronômetro (escreve na conta)
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-token: {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 17,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "start_stopwatch",
    "arguments": {
      "timeEntryId": {{timeEntryId}}
    }
  }
}

### Enviar timesheet (escreve na conta)
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-token: {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 18,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "submit_timesheet",
    "arguments": {
      "period_start": "2026-10-05",
      "period_end": "2026-10-11"
    }
  }
}
